# API Configuration
# For local development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api

# For production (update with your server URL):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-domain.com/api

# Google Sheets Integration
# The backend server requires Google Cloud credentials to access Google Sheets API
# Place your service account credentials JSON file in server/credentials.json
# Or configure OAuth credentials for user-based authentication
# See https://developers.google.com/sheets/api/quickstart/nodejs for setup instructions
